msgid "Risk review"
msgid_plural "Risk reviews"
msgstr[0] "Risk review"
msgstr[1] "Risk reviews"

msgid "Risk reviews"
msgstr "Risk reviews"

msgid "Acceptance expired"
msgstr "Acceptance expired"

msgid "Acceptance not signed"
msgstr "Acceptance not signed"

msgid "Acceptance of the risk"
msgstr "Acceptance of the risk"

msgid "Acceptance to renew soon"
msgstr "Acceptance to renew soon"

msgid "Acceptance valid until"
msgstr "Acceptance valid until"

msgid "Acceptance valid"
msgstr "Acceptance valid"

msgid "Acceptance without expiry date"
msgstr "Acceptance without expiry date"

msgid "Carries out treatment actions and updates their status."
msgstr "Carries out treatment actions and updates their status."

msgid "Choose the target risk level that the treatment must reach."
msgstr "Choose the target risk level that the treatment must reach."

msgid "Create the GLPI profiles below in one click, then assign them to people from their user record (Administration > Users, Authorizations tab). Each profile only gets what its role needs; none of them gives access to the assets. Segregation of duties does not depend on the profile: the owner of a risk can never sign its acceptance."
msgstr "Create the GLPI profiles below in one click, then assign them to people from their user record (Administration > Users, Authorizations tab). Each profile only gets what its role needs; none of them gives access to the assets. Segregation of duties does not depend on the profile: the owner of a risk can never sign its acceptance."

msgid "Create the profile"
msgstr "Create the profile"

msgid "Each review keeps a snapshot of the assessment of the risk on that day (levels and scores before and after treatment, target, treatment, progress of the plan) with the finding of the reviewer. The curve shows how the risk evolves from one review to the next: evidence that the treatment is effective (ISO/IEC 27001, clauses 6.1.3, 8.3 and 9.1). A recorded review is never modified."
msgstr "Each review keeps a snapshot of the assessment of the risk on that day (levels and scores before and after treatment, target, treatment, progress of the plan) with the finding of the reviewer. The curve shows how the risk evolves from one review to the next: evidence that the treatment is effective (ISO/IEC 27001, clauses 6.1.3, 8.3 and 9.1). A recorded review is never modified."

msgid "Effectiveness of the treatment"
msgstr "Effectiveness of the treatment"

msgid "Every action of the treatment plan is completed but the residual risk is still above the target: the treatment was not effective enough. Add actions, or record a decision."
msgstr "Every action of the treatment plan is completed but the residual risk is still above the target: the treatment was not effective enough. Add actions, or record a decision."

msgid "Every action of the treatment plan is completed: assess the residual probability and impact to check that the target is reached."
msgstr "Every action of the treatment plan is completed: assess the residual probability and impact to check that the target is reached."

msgid "Finding of the review"
msgstr "Finding of the review"

msgid "GRC - Internal audit"
msgstr "GRC - Internal audit"

msgid "GRC - Risk committee"
msgstr "GRC - Risk committee"

msgid "GRC - Risk manager"
msgstr "GRC - Risk manager"

msgid "GRC - Risk owner"
msgstr "GRC - Risk owner"

msgid "GRC - Treatment action owner"
msgstr "GRC - Treatment action owner"

msgid "Initial risk level"
msgstr "Initial risk level"

msgid "Initial risk"
msgstr "Initial risk"

msgid "Keeps the risk register: creates, assesses, reviews and closes risks, sets the appetite and signs acceptances of risks they do not own."
msgstr "Keeps the risk register: creates, assesses, reviews and closes risks, sets the appetite and signs acceptances of risks they do not own."

msgid "Level that the treatment must reach. Once every action of the treatment plan is completed, an alert is raised if the residual risk is still above it."
msgstr "Level that the treatment must reach. Once every action of the treatment plan is completed, an alert is raised if the residual risk is still above it."

msgid "Next review date"
msgstr "Next review date"

msgid "No review recorded yet."
msgstr "No review recorded yet."

msgid "No right on assets, assistance or administration"
msgstr "No right on assets, assistance or administration"

msgid "No treatment plan"
msgstr "No treatment plan"

msgid "Not created yet"
msgstr "Not created yet"

msgid "Plan completed, residual risk to assess"
msgstr "Plan completed, residual risk to assess"

msgid "Plan completed, target not reached"
msgstr "Plan completed, target not reached"

msgid "Profile created. Assign it to people from their user record."
msgstr "Profile created. Assign it to people from their user record."

msgid "Reads the risk register, its reviews and the ISMS to audit them. Read only, without any access to the assets."
msgstr "Reads the risk register, its reviews and the ISMS to audit them. Read only, without any access to the assets."

msgid "Ready-made risk management profiles"
msgstr "Ready-made risk management profiles"

msgid "Renew the acceptance (sign again)"
msgstr "Renew the acceptance (sign again)"

msgid "Review recorded."
msgstr "Review recorded."

msgid "Reviews the register and signs or renews the acceptance of residual risks owned by others."
msgstr "Reviews the register and signs or renews the acceptance of residual risks owned by others."

msgid "Rights given"
msgstr "Rights given"

msgid "Risk acceptances to renew"
msgstr "Risk acceptances to renew"

msgid "Sign the acceptance"
msgstr "Sign the acceptance"

msgid "Signed by %1$s on %2$s"
msgstr "Signed by %1$s on %2$s"

msgid "Target reached"
msgstr "Target reached"

msgid "Target risk level"
msgstr "Target risk level"

msgid "The acceptance is signed by a person other than the owner of the risk (segregation of duties), and is valid until its expiry date."
msgstr "The acceptance is signed by a person other than the owner of the risk (segregation of duties), and is valid until its expiry date."

msgid "The current assessment of the risk is saved with the review. Assess the residual risk on the form first if it has changed."
msgstr "The current assessment of the risk is saved with the review. Assess the residual risk on the form first if it has changed."

msgid "The owner of a risk cannot sign its acceptance (segregation of duties). Ask the risk manager, the risk committee or management to sign it."
msgstr "The owner of a risk cannot sign its acceptance (segregation of duties). Ask the risk manager, the risk committee or management to sign it."

msgid "The profile was not created: you need at least the rights it gives."
msgstr "The profile was not created: you need at least the rights it gives."

msgid "The target is checked for a risk to mitigate or to transfer once its treatment plan is completed."
msgstr "The target is checked for a risk to mitigate or to transfer once its treatment plan is completed."

msgid "The target will be checked once every action of the plan is completed."
msgstr "The target will be checked once every action of the plan is completed."

msgid "The treatment plan is completed and the residual risk is at or below the target."
msgstr "The treatment plan is completed and the residual risk is at or below the target."

msgid "This acceptance must be renewed: review the risk, then sign it again."
msgstr "This acceptance must be renewed: review the risk, then sign it again."

msgid "Treatment plan in progress"
msgstr "Treatment plan in progress"

msgid "Treatment plans completed without reaching the target"
msgstr "Treatment plans completed without reaching the target"

msgid "Treats the risks entrusted to them: updates the assessment, the treatment plan and records reviews. Never signs the acceptance of their own risks."
msgstr "Treats the risks entrusted to them: updates the assessment, the treatment plan and records reviews. Never signs the acceptance of their own risks."

msgid "You are the owner of this risk: you cannot sign its acceptance."
msgstr "You are the owner of this risk: you cannot sign its acceptance."

msgid "You cannot review this risk."
msgstr "You cannot review this risk."
